hyprscreend (0.0.3)  nitrux; urgency=medium

  * Preserve the user's existing monitor position in hyprextscreend instead of
    always rewriting it as "auto", which clobbered manually set positions on
    every login.
  * Relax the up-to-date check so a monitor block with any non-empty position
    (not just "auto") is considered already configured and is not rewritten.

 -- Uri Herrera <uri_herrera@nxos.org>  Sat, 23 May 2026 12:00:00 -0500

hyprscreend (0.0.2)  nitrux; urgency=medium

  * Fix external monitor matching in hyprextscreend to use exact output names
    instead of regex substring matching.
  * Skip Crystal Dock restart in greetd/greeter sessions to avoid launching it
    in the login Hyprland instance.

 -- Uri Herrera <uri_herrera@nxos.org>  Mon, 18 May 2026 00:10:00 -0500

hyprscreend (0.0.1)  nitrux; urgency=medium

  * Create package.

